#: dist/sscribe-export-site-pages/admin/class-sscribe-admin.php:316
msgid "The server could not create the ZIP archive. Common causes: the uploads directory is not writable (check folder permissions, should be 755), the server ran out of disk space, or the PHP zip extension is not installed. Contact your hosting provider if this persists."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-sscribe-admin.php:317
#: dist/sscribe-export-site-pages/admin/class-sscribe-admin.php:317
